      "id": "claim_350ae14e53584ef1bd37849e5354765a",
      "statement": "Attachment legality between a leader and a bodyguard datasheet is data, not code: leader_compatibility_11e stores one row per legal (leader_datasheet_id, bodyguard_datasheet_id) pair with a composite unique index and CASCADE foreign keys to datasheets_11e on both sides, is public-read with writes reserved for the sync-worker service role, and is populated idempotently by prisma/seed.ts.",
