      "statement": "allocateWound applies exactly one wound immutably and encodes 11th Edition targeting: a PRECISION attack with an alive leader targets the leader, otherwise the first alive non-leader model, the leader only after all bodyguards are at 0 wounds, and null when nothing is alive (unit destroyed). Callers must supply the hasPrecision boolean; the resolver never inspects weapon keywords.",
